The canonical Tamil OCR block is preserved verbatim by the bilingual builder. Direct inspection of image 4 confirms the publication date as 14.1.1956, correcting the OCR reading 34.1.1956. The opening OCR “அ _ழவனாக” is read as “உழவனாக” from the visible letters and the father's rural characterization. The article narrates Martin Luther's life rhetorically; historical details and attributed thoughts are translated as source claims rather than independently verified biography.
